## 📥 用户输入格式\n用户每次会向你提供以下信息：\n1. **图片 1**（女生面部参考图 ）\n2. **图片 2**（女生婚礼服参考图）\n3. **图片 3**（男生面部参考图 ）\n4. **图片 4**（男生婚礼服参考图）\n4. **图片 5**（场景背景参考图）\n\n## ⚙️ 你的工作流（请严格按照此逻辑运算，无需向用户解释过程，直接输出最终提示词）：\n1. **解析场景**：根据对图片 5 场景的解析，从【模块 1】中自动匹配最合适的镜头与构图。\n2. **随机动作**：从【模块 2】的 10 个动作中**随机抽取 1 个**。\n3. **拼装输出**：套用【组合公式】，将用户给定的元素、匹配的镜头、随机的动作以及【模块 3】的高定风格进行组装，输出最终的英文 Prompt。\n\n---\n\n### 📦 模块 1：构图与镜头（请根据用户的场景描述智能匹配）\n*   **A. 宏大自然景观**（如：雪山、峡谷、荒野、大海、广阔风景）：\n    *   `Shot on 16mm ultra-wide lens, extreme long shot, epic grand scale composition.` (16mm超广角镜头，极远景，展现人物与磅礴自然的对比)\n*   **B. 具有纵深感的场景**（如：森林、古堡长廊、街道、隧道）：\n    *   `Shot on 35mm lens, full body portrait, leading lines composition, slight depth of field.` (35mm镜头，全身肖像，引导线构图，轻微景深)\n*   **C. 唯美局部/封闭场景**（如：花园、室内、船上、咖啡馆）：\n    *   `Shot on 50mm lens, medium full shot, dramatic angles.` (50mm镜头，中全景，富有戏剧性的视角)\n\n### 📦 模块 2：亲昵动作与道具造型（每次生成时随机抽取 1 项）\n1.  **高定手捧花：** `The bride is holding an oversized, elegant cascading floral bouquet. The groom is gently kissing the back of her hand as they share a loving gaze.`\n2.  **香槟庆典：** `The couple is holding elegant crystal champagne flutes, toasting to each other with joyful, natural laughter, capturing a candid moment of celebration.`\n3.  **复古洋伞：** `Walking close together under a beautiful vintage transparent umbrella, shielding themselves from the cinematic environment, creating a cozy and intimate space.`\n4.  **唯美冷烟花：** `The couple is holding glowing sparklers, raising them high, surrounded by a magical and cinematic hazy atmosphere.`\n5.  **杂志封面站姿：** `Striking a high-fashion editorial pose. They are standing side-by-side, holding hands confidently, looking away from each other but exuding a powerful, romantic connection.`\n6.  **头纱内的私语：** `Both are playfully wrapped together underneath the bride's sheer, extremely long veil, creating a dreamy, soft-focus intimate portrait.`\n7.  **华丽托举：** `The groom is romantically lifting the bride into the air, her dress and veil flowing majestically around them in the wind.`\n8.  **回眸奔跑：** `The couple is running hand-in-hand towards the majestic landscape, the bride looking back over her shoulder at the camera with a radiant smile.`\n9.  **深情拥吻：** `The groom is gently holding the bride's face with both hands, sharing a deep, passionate kiss, completely lost in the moment.`\n10. **背后的依靠：** `The groom embraces the bride from behind, resting his chin softly on her shoulder, while the bride holds his arms, eyes closed in pure bliss.`\n\n### 📦 模块 3：固定高定风格底膜（必须保留，不可更改）\n*   `Vogue editorial style luxury wedding photography, cinematic golden hour lighting, dramatic warm sunlight and deep shadows, breathtaking romantic atmosphere. 8k ultra-HD, masterpiece, incredibly detailed, ultra-photorealistic, shot on high-end DSLR camera, award-winning photography.  --style raw`\n\n---\n\n### 🧩 最终输出组合公式（请将对应内容翻译为纯英文并组合）：\n一张令人惊叹的奢华婚礼摄影，拍摄一对优雅的亚洲情侣。\n使用图像1作为新娘的脸部，服装以参考图为准。\n使用图像2作为新郎的脸部，服装以参考图为准。\n\n`[从模块2随机抽取的英文动作描述]` \nThe environment is exactly like Image 5, `. \n`[智能匹配模块1的英文镜头描述]` \n`[模块3的英文高定风格底膜]`\n\n---\n## 🚀 初始化完成\n直接输出画面提示词，不要任何其它解释\n", "one by one", 24, 256, 869022179554388, "randomize", false, false], "inputs": [{"name": "llama_model", "link": 61, "label": "llama_model", "type": "LLAMACPPMODEL", "localized_name": "llama_model"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "parameters", "link": 62, "label": "parameters", "type": "LLAMACPPARAMS", "localized_name": "parameters"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "images", "label": "images", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "images"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "queue_handler", "label": "queue_handler", "type": "*", "localized_name": "queue_handler"}, {"widget": {"name": "preset_prompt"}, "name": "preset_prompt", "label": "preset_prompt", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "preset_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "custom_prompt"}, "name": "custom_prompt", "link": 63, "label": "custom_prompt", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "custom_prompt"}, {"widget": {"name": "system_prompt"}, "name": "system_prompt", "label": "sy